WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.333
Road grading holds the asphalt. Drainage and surfacing are waiting.

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:06.042
“Keep the curb at eighteen centimeters and move the grate to seventy two centimeters.”

00:00:06.042 --> 00:00:06.583
Road grading holds the asphalt. Drainage and surfacing are waiting.

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:06.958
Drainage holds the 72 cm grant. The grate is still at 50 cm.

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:12.375
“Keep the curb at eighteen centimeters and move the grate to eighty three centimeters.”

00:00:12.375 --> 00:00:12.875
Drainage holds the 72 cm grant. The grate is still at 50 cm.

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:17.125
Drainage yielded. Surfacing finished the patina before the 83 cm grant.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:18.625
Drainage moved the grate to 83 cm. The curb stayed at 18 cm.

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:20.208
Surfacing committed the road coat after the move.

00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:21.083
All three approved undo. The grate returned to 50 cm with its finish preserved.

